OL,3,GNEWSAHospital starts #5m A&E expansion
OL,4,Aproject
OL,5,
OL,6,FA hospital in Nottinghamshire is set to
OL,7,Fbenefit from a #5m project to expand
OL,8,Fthe capacity of its emergency
OL,9,Fdepartment.
OL,11,FThe changes at King's Mill Hospital in
OL,12,FSutton-in-Ashfield will provide more
OL,13,Fspace for patients with less serious
OL,14,Fconditions and increase the number of
OL,15,Fbeds for more seriously ill patients
OL,16,Ffrom 26 to 40.
OL,18,FThe hospital's ambulance access zone is
OL,19,Fto double from four to eight spaces,
OL,20,Fwhich is expected to shorten the
OL,21,Fhandover period and get crews back on
OL,22,Fto the streets faster.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
