OL,3,GNEWSAHospital starts #5m A&E expansion
OL,4,Aproject
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhile the first part of the project is
OL,7,Fexpected to be completed by next month,
OL,8,Fthe full scheme of work will not be
OL,9,Ffinished until February 2028, with some
OL,10,Fplanned changes requiring planning
OL,11,Fpermission.
